body:
@coderabbitai Valid finding, fixed in f34db19f5e.

`version_diff` is now captured with `if ! version_diff=$(git diff ...); then version_diff=""; fi`. A nonzero `git diff` exit drops any partial patch output. The existing empty-diff check in `version_lines_only` then keeps every release file in scope, so a failure always falls back to full scope.

Verification: `node --test .agents/scripts/tests/test-ci-runner-routing.mjs` runs the workflow's own classification block and passes 17/17. The `release files without diff` case covers the empty-diff fallback.

