@coderabbitai Addressed in 3a489e3a1a. `.agents/scripts/canonical-recovery-helper.sh:124` now formats the complete registry entrypoint with `%q`, as well as the registry and worktree arguments.

Verification: ShellCheck and Bash syntax checks pass. The focused integration test runs the helper from a scripts path containing spaces and a semicolon, verifies the printed argv, and successfully executes that argv. All 61 enrollment tests pass.

